<title>NORWAY: Dyno buys stake in Chile explosives group.</title>
<headline>Dyno buys stake in Chile explosives group.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian explosives and chemicals company Dyno Industrier ASA said on Tuesday it had agreed to buy a 51 percent stake in Chilean group Tec Harseim, which produces detonators and parts for explosives for the South American market.</p>
</text>
